BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 703.67 Tm (Title: Independent Administration of Estates Act \(IAEA\) in Probate) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 691.35 Tm (Channel: Meinzer Legal Briefs) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 679.02 Tm (Author: Meinzer Legal Briefs) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 666.70 Tm (Text: With limited IAEA authority you need to obtain prior court approval of selling probate estate real property, exchanging it, granting an option) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 654.37 Tm (to purchase it, and borrowing money with a loan secured by it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 642.05 Tm (Tip: With limited IAEA authority you need to obtain prior court approval of selling probate estate real property, exchanging it, granting an option) Tj ET
